{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b9d34fb9-c6cb-8b8e-b41f-766ccce19f79",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T10:31:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dario Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:28:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning, Lorraine. My name is Dario Spencer. I am calling because the edge of the road is breaking apart near my house, and honestly this is the third time I have looked at it and thought, somebody must fix this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:28:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Spencer, I can take that down. Where is the problem exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:28:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 12 Howard Street, in the Fifth Ward. There is a curve there, and the pavement at the edge is crumbling, falling off in pieces."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twelve Howard Street, at the curve. And it's the edge of the road, not the middle of the lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, the edge, where the asphalt meets the dirt. The pieces are on the ground now. Every car that takes the curve goes a little wide, so it gets worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Can you tell me about how big the damaged area is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:29:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would say it is about two feet across. Maybe a little more at the widest part, but two feet, yes. [pause] It is not a small thing, for a bicycle or a car tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across, crumbling at the edge of the curve. Did this happen recently, or has it been building up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:29:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was already starting before, but after last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, it is much bigger. Now I would like to ask, please, if you can add Howard Street to the repair list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in the request and note it for the road crew. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get to it, they're busy this time of year, but it goes on the list for them to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:29:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course, I understand. I only ask that it is written down properly, because I am tired of seeing it every morning when I leave for work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Let me read it back. Twelve Howard Street, Fifth Ward, edge of the road crumbling at the curve, about two feet across, worse since the storm over the weekend. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is exactly right. Thank you, Lorraine. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to put a phone number on the request in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is four-zero-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-seven. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You know, I have a good feeling about this call. You wrote everything carefully, so I think it will be taken seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope so. It's in the system now. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much, and have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Spencer. Bye now."
    }
  ],
